# Smart Bookmark CRUD Application

## Live Demo
https://smart-bookmark-app.onrender.com

## GitHub Repository
https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/smart-bookmark-app

## Features
- Add bookmark
- View bookmarks
- Update bookmark
- Delete bookmark

## Tech Stack
- Node.js
- Express
- HTML, CSS, JS

## Run Locally
npm install -y
npm install express
npm install cors
npm start